<title>USA: Sun Microsystems shareholders OK split.</title>
<headline>Sun Microsystems shareholders OK split.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sun Microsystems Inc said its shareholders approved an increase of its common shares in the form of a two-for-one stock split.</p>
<p>The split will be effected in the form of a stock dividend, payable December 10 to shareholders of record November 18.</p>
<p>After the split, Sun Microsystems will have 367,297,064 common shares outstanding.</p>
